# Sanctioned maintenance-mode marker honoured by scripts/auto-pull.sh (task
# #2279). Checkout-root runtime state whose whole purpose is to be host-local —
# a freeze window opened on the cell must not travel to another box through a
# commit, and a committed marker would pause every checkout permanently.
/.maintenance-pause

# SSH private keys (public keys are safe to commit)
id_ed25519
id_rsa
*.pem
*_dropbear
